        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Apple 2030 — Approach — 2024 Environmental Progress Report</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #1d1d1f;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 2560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 45px 80px 120px 80px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Top navigation ---------- */\n  .topbar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  .nav-main { display: flex; gap: 26px; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .nav-main .item { color: #86868b; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .nav-main .active-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .nav-main .active-group .item.current { color: #1d1d1f; font-weight: 700; }\n  .nav-main .sub { color: #1d1d1f; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; }\n  .nav-main .sub.selected { border-bottom: 1.5px solid #1d1d1f; align-self: flex-start; }\n  .nav-right { color: #6e6e73; white-space: nowrap; display: flex; gap: 12px; }\n  .nav-right .rep { color: #1d1d1f; }\n  .nav-right .pageno { color: #1d1d1f; margin-left: 22px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Title ---------- */\n  .approach {\n    margin-top: 130px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -0.2px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    margin: 14px 0 0 0;\n    font-size: 92px;\n    line-height: 1.02;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -2.5px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Main content zones ---------- */\n  .content {\n    display: flex;\n    margin-top: 105px;\n    gap: 0;\n  }\n  .left-zone { display: flex; gap: 60px; width: 1030px; flex: 0 0 1030px; }\n  .col { width: 450px; flex: 0 0 450px; }\n\n  .lede {\n    font-size: 28.5px;\n    line-height: 1.34;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -0.35px;\n    margin: 0 0 34px 0;\n  }\n  p.body {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    color: #6e6e73;\n    margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n  }\n  sup { font-size: 12px; vertical-align: super; }\n\n  /* ---------- Roadmap zone ---------- */\n  .roadmap { margin-left: 135px; flex: 1; }\n  .eyebrow {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1.4px;\n    color: #6e6e73;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .roadmap h2 {\n    font-size: 32px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -0.4px;\n    margin: 0 0 60px 0;\n    max-width: 700px;\n  }\n\n  .pillars { display: flex; align-items: stretch; }\n  .group {\n    display: flex;\n    position: relative;\n    border-left: 1px solid #d2d2d7;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #d2d2d7;\n    padding-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n  .group.g1 { width: 890px; }\n  .group.g2 { width: 560px; margin-left: 20px; }\n\n  .pillar { width: 305px; flex: 0 0 305px; padding: 0 34px 0 22px; }\n  .icon {\n    height: 52px;\n    margin-top: -66px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    color: #1db954;\n  }\n  .icon svg { display: block; }\n  .pillar h3 {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -0.2px;\n    margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n  }\n  .pillar p {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #6e6e73;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .stat {\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.28;\n    letter-spacing: -0.3px;\n    margin-top: 150px;\n  }\n  .arrow-head {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -1px;\n    bottom: -9px;\n    width: 0; height: 0;\n    border-top: 8px solid transparent;\n    border-bottom: 8px solid transparent;\n    border-left: 14px solid #d2d2d7;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- Top navigation -->\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"nav-main\">\n      <span class=\"item\">Contents</span>\n      <span class=\"item\">Introduction</span>\n      <div class=\"active-group\">\n        <span class=\"item current\">Environmental Initiatives</span>\n        <span class=\"sub selected\">Apple 2030</span>\n        <span class=\"sub\">Resources</span>\n        <span class=\"sub\">Smarter Chemistry</span>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"item\">Engagement and Advocacy</span>\n      <span class=\"item\">Data</span>\n      <span class=\"item\">Appendix</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"nav-right\">\n      <span>2024</span><span class=\"rep\">Environmental Progress Report</span><span class=\"pageno\">12</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Title block -->\n  <div class=\"approach\">Approach</div>\n  <h1>Apple 2030</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <!-- Left two text columns -->\n    <div class=\"left-zone\">\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <p class=\"lede\">We have an ambitious commitment and a science-based plan to reach our Apple 2030 goal. We're focused on achieving reductions wherever possible, using approaches that offer clear evidence for a way forward while seeking to catalyze industry-wide change.</p>\n        <p class=\"body\">This begins with working to achieve carbon neutrality across our entire carbon footprint by 2030, setting ambitious targets to reduce our emissions by 75 percent. We prioritize carbon reductions, but for emissions that can't be mitigated using existing solutions we invest in high-quality carbon removal projects.</p>\n        <p class=\"body\">Our goal to be carbon neutral extends to our entire carbon footprint and is consistent with the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change's (IPCC) recommendation for global carbon neutrality.<sup>24</sup></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <p class=\"body\">We're also committed to working toward reaching a 90 percent reduction in emissions from our 2015 baseline by 2050. Attaining deep decarbonization will require a collective, worldwide effort. Entire industries and economies must decarbonize. And while reaching a 90 percent reduction in emissions is outside Apple's or any one company's control, we're committed to taking actions that support this goal.</p>\n        <p class=\"body\">We've made significant progress by cutting emissions across our value chain by more than 55 percent since 2015. This started with our transition to sourcing 100 percent renewable electricity at our offices, retail stores, and data centers, which we achieved in 2018. And in 2020, we achieved carbon neutrality for our corporate emissions.<sup>25</sup></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right roadmap zone -->\n    <div class=\"roadmap\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Apple 2030 Roadmap</div>\n      <h2>Addressing Apple's carbon footprint<br>through four pillars</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"pillars\">\n        <div class=\"group g1\">\n          <div class=\"pillar\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">\n              <svg width=\"52\" height=\"52\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1db954\" stroke-width=\"2.6\">\n                <circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"17\"/>\n                <path d=\"M33 19c0 9-5 14-12 15\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                <path d=\"M21 34c8-1 12-6 12-15-8 0-12 4-12 15z\" fill=\"#1db954\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Design and materials</h3>\n            <p>Designing products and manufacturing processes to be less carbon intensive through thoughtful material selection, increased material efficiency, greater product energy efficiency, the use of recycled and renewable materials in our products and packaging, and enhanced material recovery</p>\n            <div class=\"stat\">&gt;75 percent<br>emissions reduction</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pillar\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">\n              <svg width=\"52\" height=\"52\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 52\">\n                <path d=\"M29 6L15 30h9l-3 16 17-25h-10l3-15z\" fill=\"#1db954\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Electricity</h3>\n            <p>Increasing energy efficiency at our facilities and in our supply chain, and transitioning the electricity in our entire product value chain — including manufacturing and our customers' product use — to 100 percent clean electricity by 2030</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pillar\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">\n              <svg width=\"52\" height=\"52\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 52\">\n                <path d=\"M8 34h36V16l-11 8V16l-11 8v-6H8z\" fill=\"#1db954\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Direct emissions</h3>\n            <p>Reducing direct greenhouse gas emissions in our facilities and our supply chain through process innovation, emissions abatement, and shifting away from fossil fuels</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"arrow-head\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"group g2\">\n          <div class=\"pillar\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">\n              <svg width=\"52\" height=\"52\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1db954\" stroke-width=\"2.4\">\n                <path d=\"M14 26a7 7 0 010-8 9 9 0 0117-3 8 8 0 016 11H14z\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n                <text x=\"26\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#1db954\" stroke=\"none\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Helvetica\">CO₂</text>\n                <path d=\"M17 32v7M26 32v9M35 32v7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                <path d=\"M17 39l-2-3M17 39l2-3M26 41l-2-3M26 41l2-3M35 39l-2-3M35 39l2-3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Carbon removal</h3>\n            <p>In parallel with our emissions reduction efforts, scaling up investments in carbon removal projects, including nature-based solutions that protect and restore ecosystems around the world</p>\n            <div class=\"stat\">&lt;25 percent of<br>footprint</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"arrow-head\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
